  "description": "To interrogate alterations in BRCA1 binding to pH2AX across different phases of the cell cycle, and after ionizing radiation treatment.\nConclusion: \nWe found that ionizing radiation increased said interaction in G1, but the most striking differences we observed were in untreated cells between G1 and S/G2. All antibodies were rigorously titrated, along with SLA reagents. Detergent pre-extraction protocol was optimize to improve signal-to-noise ratio and bring out interactions between pH2AX and exclusively chromatin-bound BRCA1.",
